  THE ZONOTOPAL GEOMETRY CONNECTION:

  Kolesnik-Sanchez (DCG 2024): tournaments correspond to
  vertices of the unit cube {0,1}^m. Score sequences are
  projections onto the permutohedron Pi_n (a zonotope).

  The score map pi: {0,1}^m -> Pi_n sends each tournament
  to its score sequence. The FIBERS pi^{-1}(s) are the
  tournaments with score s.

